    "不划区域也能识别，但整桌入镜时牌小、易混入别人的牌，准确率会下降；建议先圈出自己的手牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognition works without drawing a box too, but a whole-table shot makes tiles small and easy to mix up with other players' — circling your own tiles first is recommended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不划区域也能识别，但整桌入镜时牌小、易混入别人的牌，准确率会下降；建议先圈出自己的手牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
