    "识别到 %lld 张牌（应为 13 或 14），可能混入了桌上其他人的牌，或有漏识别。已回填识别结果，请核对后再分析。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognized %lld tiles (13 or 14 expected). Other players' tiles may have slipped in, or some were missed. The result has been filled in — check it, then analyze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "识别到超过 %lld 张牌，已保留前 %lld 张。": {
      "localizations": {
